# node-forge@1.4.0 (CVE-2026-85393) — HIGH, RSA PKCS#1 v1.5 signature forgery.
# Transitive build-time dep of expo → @expo/cli / @expo/code-signing-certificates
# (apps/mobile). Not shipped in any runtime artifact; Relay's APK builds do not
# verify third-party PKCS#1 signatures. No fixed release exists as of
# 2026-10-02 (1.4.0 is latest). Revisit: 2026-12-01 or on first node-forge
# release, whichever is earlier.
CVE-2026-85393

# braces@3.0.3 (CVE-2026-93687) — HIGH, DoS via stack overflow on deeply
# nested glob patterns. Transitive of expo → @expo/metro-file-map →
# micromatch (apps/mobile). Only bundler-facing; patterns are static app
# config, not user input. No fixed release exists as of 2026-10-03
# (3.0.3 is latest). Revisit: 2026-12-01 or on first braces release.
CVE-2026-93687
